Fukuii is a Scala execution client for the EVM ecosystem: several networks at once in one JVM
process, and a further network is configuration, not a new client. It is Ethereum Classic's first
native client. https://fukuii.org

Fukuii acknowledges two projects it owes for vision and for tech stack, and takes no code from
either: ETCDEV's Orbita (2018), an early multi-network client vision for Ethereum Classic; and
IOHK's Mantis, which chose Scala and the JVM for the task.

Fukuii is an independent, ground-up client. It contains no Mantis source code and is not a
derivative work of Mantis. "Mantis" is a trademark of IOHK, referenced only for lineage and the
project's name story.
